'''''Small Town Grotesque''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[In Our Time]].

==Steps==
# Advance down the narrow alley
# (Optional) Speak with Welt
# (Optional) Speak with Firefly
# Advance down the narrow alley
# Wait for the elevator to arrive
# Confirm the situation with Misha
# Follow Misha and explore Dreamflux Reef
# Follow Misha and head to the trading district to search for your partners
# Find Aunt Jessie
# Search for Himeko
# Meet with the special guest

