===Advance down the narrow alley{{subst:void|<!--103240101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=The Reverie (Dreamscape)|Firefly explains to you the deeper reasons behind her various inexplicable behaviors, and guides you to dive deeper into a place declared as a "nightmare" by The Family... The primitive Memory Zone outside the sweet dream: "Dreamflux Reef." This move also exposes some of the truths behind "Death" &mdash; It is nothing but a tamed memetic entity that assists specific people who wish to travel between dreams. "Closing your eyes" is merely a strange invocation used to summon them.<br />After a brief moment of discomfort, you realize that you have arrived at an abandoned old town. Once you have spoken with everyone and prepared yourself, alight and begin your adventure at this abandoned station.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Firefly:''' We're back to where it all began. You entered the Golden Hour from this place, and it is also from here where you will enter the true {{Rubi|Penacony|Land of the Exiles}}.
:'''Firefly:''' It's a pleasure to journey alongside you once more, but it's time I laid bare the entire truth before you. As you might have heard... I also go by another name: Stellaron Hunter, Sam.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you... all right?
::'''Firefly:''' I'm fine... Sorry, I hope I haven't scared you.
::You lied to me...
::'''Firefly:''' I'm sorry. I had no other choice...
::Are you... Firefly's soul?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You lied to me...
::'''Firefly:''' I'm sorry. I had no other choice...
::Are you... Firefly's soul?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you... Firefly's soul?
:'''Firefly:''' I know you have many questions... Do you remember when we encountered "Death" in that strange Dreamscape? When I was caught by that meme...
:'''Firefly:''' In that instant before it killed me, I saw the reflection of another Dreamscape in its ghastly pupils.
:'''Firefly:''' So, following the clues in the '''script''', I came up with some theories about the meme. That's why I instructed Silver Wolf to issue invitations, drawing everyone to the dream's hotel...
:'''Firefly:''' I intended to call upon "Death" before you arrived, to solve the riddle using more direct means, and then invite you to join. However, contrary to my wishes, I couldn't defy the '''script''', and I didn't get a chance to explain it to you.
:'''Firefly:''' It is how you see now &mdash; I was impaled by the bladed wings of "Death." The heavy pressure of concentrated memoria miasma... exploded in my mind, as if it was actually reality.
:'''Firefly:''' But after the momentary numbness subsided, I found that my body was absolutely unscathed.
:'''Firefly:''' I was still alive, and it was just as I thought &mdash; I had arrived at a place starkly different from this beautiful dream. Beneath the Dreamscape of Penacony lies another more chaotic, more primal Memory Zone. Its name... Land of the Exiles.
:'''Firefly:''' And so then I returned to the hotel in the Dreamscape, hoping to tell you of its existence. Yet I could not reveal my own identity, so I could only divert your party's attention and lure you away from the battlefield.
:'''Firefly:''' And after, all my attempts proved futile. It wasn't until not long ago, when a crimson blade of light shattered the high wall of the dream, causing you all to fall far into the abyssal depths of the Dreamscape, that I was able to awaken you and your companions one by one...
:'''Firefly:''' And that's it, that is all that's happened so far.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I completely understand!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm completely confused!
:'''Firefly:''' I know it's tough to believe all this without reservations. I just want to say you're very close to the final answer &mdash; just one more thing needs to be done, and then I can prove it to you...
:{{tx}}
